  silhouette on a transparent background, as the platform requires for a notification's
  small icon (the system masks it to the current icon color itself; any other fill would
  render as a solid block on some launchers). Same stopwatch-ring shape as the Activités
  tab icon in HelionNavHost.kt, simplified to a single opaque path since a notification
  icon has no room for the tab icon's two-tone crown-and-hand detail.
-->
